    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "2. 关于中心对称的直线的定理是直线平行的一个判定定理。\n现在来证明直线平行的另一个判定定理。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 140,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0150#10"
      ],
      "source_text": "2. 关于中心对称的直线的定理是直线平行的一个判定定理。现在来证明直线平行的另一个判定定理。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "40 定理．\n如果两条直线垂直于同一条直线，那么这两条直线平行。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 140,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0150#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "40 定理．如果两条直线垂直于同一条直线，那么这两条直线平行。",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "已知：\n$a\\perp p,b\\perp p,a\\ne b$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 141,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0151#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "已知：$a\\perp p,b\\perp p,a\\ne b$．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求证：\n$a\\parallel b$．",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 141,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0151#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "求证：$a\\parallel b$．",
      "changes": [
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "证明．\n假设直线 $a$ 和 $b$ 相交于点 $M$（图 203）．\n那么，经过点$M$可以作两条直线垂直于直线 $p$，这与命题 19 相矛盾．\n\n就是说，我们的假设是不正确的．\n所以直线 $a$ 和直线 $b$ 平行．\n$\\blacksquare$",
      "id": null,
